      "filename": "Mainzer Adelsverein Karte von Indian Point od. Indianola 1851 UTA.jpg",
      "title": "File:Mainzer Adelsverein Karte von Indian Point od. Indianola 1851 UTA.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/Mainzer_Adelsverein_Karte_von_Indian_Point_od._Indianola_1851_UTA.jpg",
